00:20:39,060 --> 00:20:40,480
It's getting crazy out there.

254
00:20:40,600 --> 00:20:42,740
I don't know if they're shouting Anko or Encore.

255
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:44,340
I was sent to get Miku.

256
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:47,400
Oh, hey, Toka, what's up?

257
00:20:47,760 --> 00:20:49,320
I don't know.

258
00:20:49,560 --> 00:20:50,920
Why don't you try telling me?

259
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:51,480
Quickly!

260
00:20:51,860 --> 00:20:52,940
Oh, calm down.

261
00:20:53,280 --> 00:20:54,600
There's a reason for this.

262
00:20:54,660 --> 00:20:55,900
Hey, darling.

263
00:20:56,120 --> 00:20:56,360
Yeah?

264
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:57,920
Dar-what?

265
00:20:57,920 --> 00:21:01,360
Will you please watch my Encore?

266
00:21:01,620 --> 00:21:02,100
Sure.

267
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:03,380
Hmm?

268
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:10,400
Thank you all so much.

269
00:21:10,760 --> 00:21:14,960
Tonight I'm going to sing a very special and important song, so I hope you like it.

270
00:21:23,700 --> 00:21:26,480
Well, girls, it looks like she's back.

271
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:30,220
Singing in the shower

272
00:21:30,220 --> 00:21:37,220
Me believing I am on a stage

273
00:21:37,220 --> 00:21:42,980
Hearing my voice resound in the room

274
00:21:42,980 --> 00:21:48,320
La-la-la, la-la-la, I sing on

275
00:21:48,320 --> 00:21:54,320
Reverb is bouncing off each wall around me

276
00:21:54,320 --> 00:22:00,060
Every echo sounds so special and so astounding

277
00:22:00,060 --> 00:22:04,060
Even though I am happy

278
00:22:04,060 --> 00:22:11,800
I hope that I won't forget how I felt once before

279
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:16,160
Let me sing you a song

280
00:22:16,160 --> 00:22:19,200
And let's sing along

281
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:25,000
The greatest gift of all are all the stars up in the sky

282
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:28,140
Millions sparkle above

283
00:22:28,140 --> 00:22:34,740
And light the night

284
00:22:34,740 --> 00:22:46,480
Thank you so much, everyone out there.

285
00:22:46,480 --> 00:23:01,220
Thank you so much, everyone out there, thank you

286
00:23:01,220 --> 00:23:03,860
Thank you, darling

287
00:23:03,860 --> 00:23:05,500
Thank you so much

288
00:23:05,500 --> 00:23:06,500
I love you

289
00:23:06,500 --> 00:23:10,700
What's darling?

290
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:12,580
Yes, please, answer

291
00:23:12,580 --> 00:23:14,300
Darling?

292
00:23:14,640 --> 00:23:16,340
Wait, don't tell me this

293
00:23:16,340 --> 00:23:19,580
Speaking of which, Miku called you that earlier, didn't she?

294
00:23:19,840 --> 00:23:20,220
Shido?

295
00:23:20,580 --> 00:23:22,540
We'd like to know what darling means

296
00:23:22,540 --> 00:23:23,900
Well, that's...

297
00:23:23,900 --> 00:23:24,480
Shido?

298
00:23:24,660 --> 00:23:25,300
Confirmation

299
00:23:25,300 --> 00:23:26,240
Shido

300
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:27,320
Shido?

301
00:23:27,620 --> 00:23:28,900
Oh, no, Shido

302
00:23:28,900 --> 00:23:30,420
What does it mean?

303
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,080
You're so popular, Shido

304
00:23:37,080 --> 00:23:39,080
Mm-mm

